category: Libs
build-depends: cygport asciidoc docbook-xml45 libxml2
sdesc: "C preprocessor designed to be embeddable, quick, light and fully compliant to C99 (utilities)"
ldesc: "A C preprocessor is a part of a C compiler responsible for macro replacement,
conditional compilation and inclusion of header files. It is often found as a
stand-alone program on Unix systems."
